    <string name="statistics_export_terms">## Terms</string>
    <string name="statistics_export_term_day">- **Day:** runs from 04:00 to 04:00. A record made at 01:00 belongs to the day before. A row\'s date is always the day it is about, also for a view recorded the morning after.</string>
    <string name="statistics_export_term_kept">- **Kept:** the day met the view\'s plan.</string>
    <string name="statistics_export_term_missed">- **Missed:** the day did not meet the plan and nothing excused it.</string>
    <string name="statistics_export_term_excused">- **Excused:** sick, or away on a day the view does not ask for.</string>
    <string name="statistics_export_term_rest">- **Rest day:** a day without training that Activity\'s weekly goal allows. Not a miss.</string>
    <string name="statistics_export_term_free">- **Free day:** a day a weekly goal leaves free. Not a miss.</string>
    <string name="statistics_export_term_protected">- **Protected:** a missed day whose streak was saved by a token (one view) or a freeze (all views). The record stays missed.</string>
    <!-- %s: today. -->
    <string name="statistics_export_about">- Recorded about: %s.</string>
    <string name="statistics_export_about_today">the day itself</string>
    <string name="statistics_export_about_yesterday">the day before, recorded the morning after</string>
    <string name="statistics_export_term_streak">- **Streak:** the number of kept days in a row. A protected day keeps the streak going but does not add to it, so a streak counts days kept, not days passed.</string>
    <string name="statistics_export_term_today">- **Today** (%s) is not over; its row shows what is recorded so far and has no result.</string>
